  "notes": "{握|にぎ}る is a godan verb meaning \"to grasp\" or \"to grip.\" It has both literal and figurative uses.\n\nTRANSITIVITY: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive)\n\nSENSE 1 - PHYSICAL GRASP:\n- ⟦ハンドル→ハンドル：06331_handoru⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{握|にぎ}る: to grip the steering wheel\n- ⟦{手|て}→手：00569_te⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{握|にぎ}る: to hold hands\n- ⟦{拳|こぶし}→拳：05855_kobushi⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{握|にぎ}る: to clench one's fist\n\nSENSE 2 - SUSHI:\n- ⟦{寿司|すし}→寿司：04946_sushi⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{握|にぎ}る: to make (hand-pressed) sushi\n- ⟦{握|にぎ}り{寿司|ずし}→握り寿司：19145_nigirizushi⟧: nigiri sushi\n\nSENSE 3 - FIGURATIVE (CONTROL):\n- ⟦{権力|けんりょく}→権力：10020_kenryoku⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{握|にぎ}る: to hold power\n- ⟦{秘密|ひみつ}→秘密：02504_himitsu⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{握|にぎ}る: to hold a secret\n- ⟦{鍵|かぎ}→鍵：02189_kagi⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{握|にぎ}る: to hold the key (to something)",
